**Any change** (implement, fix, add, refactor, build) → follow the `camstack-workflow` skill first: `/camstack-workflow`, or read `.claude/skills/camstack-workflow/SKILL.md`. It sets the phases, the gates and the definition of done; the other skills give the details.

Ask the operator with the `AskQuestion` tool (it is reliably offered in Plan mode — Shift+Tab): one decision per question, 2–4 options, the recommendation first. No picker → a numbered list with the recommendation marked, then stop and wait.
